---

---

<section
    class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-15 md:py-section-gap bg-surface-bright max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto relative overflow-hidden"
>
    <div
        class="absolute bottom-10 left-10 w-48 h-48 opacity-[0.07] pattern-dots pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16 md:w-2/3">
            <h2 class="text-headline-xl font-semibold text-on-background mb-4">
                Kami Membantu <span class="text-tomato marker-highlight"
                    >Berbagai Industri</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
                Setiap bisnis punya tantangan operasional unik. Solusi kami
                fleksibel untuk berbagai sektor.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
            <!-- Featured: UMKM & Retail -->
            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 border-2 border-tomato/25 relative shadow-md md:flex items-start gap-10"
            >
                <div
                    class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 w-8 h-8 bg-tomato rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[11px] font-bold shadow-md"
                >
                    #1
                </div>
                <div
                    class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-pastel-peach flex items-center justify-center mb-5 md:mb-0 md:shrink-0"
                >
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-tomato"
                        >store</span
                    >
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-headline-lg font-semibold mb-2">
                        <span class="marker-highlight">UMKM & Retail</span>
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl">
                        Toko offline dan online yang kewalahan dengan ribuan
                        pertanyaan stok, harga, dan resi setiap harinya.
                        Otomatisasi kami menangani percakapan rutin, tim Anda
                        fokus pada layanan pelanggan dan strategi bisnis.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Middle row: two different visual styles -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <div
                    class="bg-pastel-peach rounded-3xl p-8 relative overflow-hidden"
                >
                    <div
                        class="absolute -top-8 -right-8 w-32 h-32 bg-white/30 rounded-full"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <div
                            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white flex items-center justify-center mb-5 shadow-sm"
                        >
                            <span
                                class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl text-secondary"
                                >business_center</span
                            >
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-headline-md font-semibold mb-2">
                            Service Business
                        </h3>
                        <p
                            class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
                        >
                            Jasa salon, bengkel, wedding organizer - bisnis yang
                            sangat bergantung pada booking dan follow-up klien.
                            Kami otomatiskan jadwal dan pengingat, tidak ada
                            pelanggan yang terlewat.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div
                    class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border-l-[6px] border-secondary relative shadow-sm"
                >
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-5">
                        <div
                            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-bright flex items-center justify-center"
                        >
                            <span
                                class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl text-tomato"
                                >local_shipping</span
                            >
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-headline-md font-semibold">
                            Distribusi
                        </h3>
                    </div>
                    <p
                        class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed"
                    >
                        Tracking order dan komunikasi cepat dengan reseller di
                        seluruh Indonesia. Semua notifikasi dan follow-up
                        berjalan otomatis, tim Anda tidak kewalahan.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Properti callout -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-center">
                <div class="hidden md:flex md:col-span-1 justify-center">
                    <svg
                        class="w-8 h-16 text-tomato/30"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 30 60"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M15,5 C15,5 5,20 15,30 C25,40 10,55 10,55"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-width="2"></path>
                        <path
                            d="M10,48 L18,55 L12,60"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="md:col-span-11 bg-white border border-border-base rounded-2xl p-6 md:flex items-center gap-6 hover:border-tomato/20 transition-colors"
                >
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4 md:mb-0">
                        <div
                            class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-pastel-peach flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"
                        >
                            <span
                                class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl text-tomato"
                                >real_estate_agent</span
                            >
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-headline-md font-semibold md:hidden">
                            Properti
                        </h3>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3
                            class="text-headline-md font-semibold mb-1 hidden md:block"
                        >
                            Properti
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
                            Agen properti yang kehilangan leads karena respon
                            lambat ke calon pembeli atau penyewa. Dengan respon
                            instan 24/7, tidak ada calon pembeli yang menguap.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
